Creates the required matrices for a WaveT run or a freq_bem calculation by using the mesh provided by GMSH. 
The script create_mesh.sh creates the file.msh, calling the executable gmsh, from info on sphere position and size contained in spheres.inp
To run:
1. Edit the spheres.inp file to chose the desired particle shape
2. Create the mesh 
 # ./create_mesh.sh           
3. Then run (e.g.)
 # ../../TDPlas/bin/tdplas.x < tdplas_nas.inp > tdplas.out

